<title>USA: U.S. Electricar Inc Q3 shr loss shrinks.</title>
<headline>U.S. Electricar Inc Q3 shr loss shrinks.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended April 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		$0.003     loss	 $0.06</p>
<p> Net profit		   475     loss	 3,498</p>
<p> Revs			 2,856			478</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 137,632		   62,665</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		  $0.033     loss	 $0.13</p>
<p> Net loss		   4,201     loss	 7,898</p>
<p> Revs			 3,754		    3,489</p>
<p>Avg shrs 128,361 56,873</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q3 1997 includes revenue generated from the sale of a $2 million technology license to Hyundai Motor Co and Hyundai Electronics Industries Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Including revenue from the sale of the license, the company reported Q3 net income of $475,000.</p>
<p>Q3 1996 included a gain on debt restructuring of $1.86 million.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
